This folder contains result from global multi-grid runs using
the following grids:
GLOBAL
PACE
ATNW
ATNE
NC
CRB
Hence if you want higher resolution data from some of these regions 
you will have in these other folders a fully consistent higher resolution 
data. 

The model was run with both ECMWF operational analyses and CFSR / CFSRR winds. 
The runs used to have only ~ 1000 output spectral points (ASCII files in 
SPEC folder). The model is being rerun with ~9000 points, now stored in NetCDF. 
As a result the frequency spectra (in FREQ) are changing names from mww3.* 
to ww3.*  

As of August 21, 2013, this has been done for 
2011_CFSR
2008_ECMWF
2013_ECMWF. 

Also, CFSR runs for years 2007-2012 use a lower wind-wave growth parameter
to correct for time-varying biases (see README in main HINDCAST folder). 

